# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit the real .env.

# Formspree (https://formspree.io) endpoint the "Request Demo" form posts to.
# 1. Sign up at formspree.io and create a new form.
# 2. Set the form's notification email to trackmarg@gmail.com.
# 3. Paste the endpoint shown for it below (looks like https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx).
# Leave unset and the button falls back to a plain mailto link.
VITE_DEMO_FORM_ENDPOINT=
